  "_note": "GENRE TRAP WARNING — read before running factory:make with this spec. The `sorting` block below is a HAND-OFF CONTRACT for the custom implementation, not generator input: no code under dev_game/generator/src reads it, and schema v1 does not declare it (it passes validation only because additionalProperties is unset). Schema v1 has no vocabulary for conveyors, destination bins, or drag-and-drop sorting, so the mechanical fields describe a falling-hazard arcade and nothing else. Running this spec through factory:make yields a playable dodge-the-hazard game with themed labels — that is a scaffold, not the described game, and must not be reported as one. For a genre outside the v1 arcade vocabulary, use schema v2 with buildDecision 'custom-loop' instead of relabeling this one."
